dms.machine

  ⚠ machine-favored phrasing peaks at 'revealed itself: The'
    ╭─[corpus/llm/blog/19f12335d308d0e0.md:29:1]
 28 │ 
 29 │ Here's where the ghost revealed itself: The `try...catch` block was catching exceptions during message processing. Instead of releasing the associated objects from the heap, the exception handler simply swallowed the error and continued to hold onto the message object.  Because this listener never exited, it kept accumulating new message objects, leading to a relentless increase in memory usage.
    · ─────────────────────┬─────────────────────
    ·                      ╰── machine-favored phrasing peaks at 'revealed itself: The'
 30 │ 
